  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Institutional Capacities of Ukraine&#x2019;s Judicial Administration Bodies</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the transparency and accountability of Ukrainian judiciary, The project aims are:
1.	Advance accountability-driven organizational change of Ukrainian judicial administration .
2.	Improve knowledge of international standards applicable to judicial governance and inclusion among Ukraine&#x2019;s judicial administration improved
3.	Institutionalize transparent appointment and sanctioning of judges.
4.	Resolve the backlog in judicial appointments in line with ethical and merit-based standards. Provide expert, technical, and logistical assistance to the HQCJ in the organization of an open and merit-based competition for vacant judgeship positions 
5.	Support digital transformation of Ukraine&#x2019;s judiciary</narrative>
  </description>
